Original neck: -r*x*y + w*z
Component blowup chart1: r=z*a, w=a*x*y; smooth affine C4.
Component blowup chart2 strict transform: b*w - x*y with independent r.
Small resolution chart1: b=x*k, y=k*w; smooth affine C4.
Small resolution chart2: x=b*k, w=k*y; smooth affine C4.
Involution: r -> -r, z -> z, w -> -w, x,y fixed.
It preserves (z,r) and (b,x); every equation checked exactly.
Global gluing and identification with the prescribed A2 fan are separate proof obligations.
